        <mda:meta type="pos_id">11</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="reviewed">
        <source>::The console's display struggles to work as it seems to have issues with it's power supply. Behind it, you notice that the cables lying on the floor are in bad condition. The cables themselves feature a modular design, which alows them to be easily plugged one into another. About half of the cables that are going to the back of the console are heavily damaged. The cables on your right side are further connected to the large crane nearby. They are all in decent shape. Console's flickering display displays a barely readable massage: Insufficient power.::&amp;lt;end&amp;gt;</source>
        <target state="final">::The console's display struggles to work as it seems to have issues with it's power supply. Behind it, you notice that the cables lying on the floor are in bad condition. The cables themselves feature a modular design, which alows them to be easily plugged one into another. About half of the cables that are going to the back of the console are heavily damaged. The cables on your right side are further connected to the large crane nearby. They are all in decent shape. Console's flickering display displays a barely readable massage: Insufficient power.::&amp;lt;end&amp;gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
